Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:02:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Raise your fist{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:14.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.34,0:02:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.73,0:02:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,H-He is... alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ushimitsu Kozo got caught?! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.07,0:02:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.03,0:02:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, it's written in the broadsheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:47.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll be executed in the capital today...\NAnd they found out his identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.25,0:02:51.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I think he's popular in Ebisu Town...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.42,0:02:52.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You said Ebisu Town?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:56.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. And his name is, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:58.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Yasu-something...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:02:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tonoyasu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.85,0:03:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where do you think you're going?!\NYour life is in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.27,0:03:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.69,0:03:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.82,0:03:23.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Get yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.57,0:03:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.16,0:03:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.79,0:03:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toko!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.87,0:03:31.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll be executed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.17,0:03:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He'll be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.50,0:03:40.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.14,0:03:54.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seems like it will be a lovely day\Nin the Flower Capital today...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.69,0:03:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}"The Straw Hats Run!\NSave the Captive Tonoyasu!"{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:26.80,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,FLOWER CAPITAL
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.09,0:04:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How could this have happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.34,0:04:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Komurasaki-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What I wouldn't give to see her once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.99,0:04:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't the Oiran procession \NI wanted to see...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.99,0:04:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where are you taking her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.08,0:04:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She rebelled against Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.33,0:04:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll cremate her at the Prisoners' \NQuarters in Rasetsu Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.09,0:05:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}As soon as you arrive, Orochi-sama,\Nwe will execute him as an offering!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.59,0:05:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Mm-hm, I will be there soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.31,0:05:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hearing his dying scream...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.77,0:05:19.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...will heal the pain of losing Komurasaki\Na little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.11,0:05:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Today is a great day!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.69,0:05:25.15,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,UDON
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is Komurasaki-{\i1}tan{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.97,0:05:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I don't see her anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.89,0:05:55.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're still transporting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.60,0:06:01.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that place on the screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:04.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's the Prisoners' \NQuarters in Rasetsu Town.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.61,0:06:08.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Many criminals are held there,\Nthough not as many as here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:34.56,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,PRISONERS' QUARTERS, RASETSU TOWN\NFLOWER CAPITAL
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:55.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Raise the post.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:39.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.96,0:07:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oden (stew) wouldn't be "oden"...\Nif it wasn't boiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.02,0:08:07.02,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,EBISU TOWN
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.94,0:08:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tonoyasu's been caught?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.19,0:08:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe Tonoyasu-{\i1}san \{\i0}Nis Ushimitsu Kozo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.32,0:08:18.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ushimitsu Kozo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The great thief who steals money and goods\Nfrom the rich,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:27.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,and gives them away to the poor and the weak\Nevery night...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thief?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.46,0:08:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That old geezer?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ushimitsu Kozo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I heard people talking about him\Nin the Flower Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.18,0:08:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is this all about?\NI thought he was a saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.86,0:08:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tonoyasu-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why's everyone laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your friend's been strung up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.50,0:09:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is Tonoyasu-{\i1}san{\i0} really Ushimitsu Kozo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.67,0:09:19.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if it's true,\Nthat's not what's really important.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.93,0:09:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I remember! That hairstyle...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.60,0:09:29.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Tonoyasu is a fake name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:32.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.07,0:09:35.82,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,BAKURA TOWN, KURI
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.98,0:09:38.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Seems like something exciting is\Nhappening in the Flower Capital...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.32,0:09:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Turn on the Light-Scroll Snail!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Let's look for Ashura!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way... That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.31,0:10:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He is alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:16.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.44,0:10:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I know him pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.03,0:10:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That gentleman...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:29.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...used to be one of the Daimyo who served \Nunder the Kozuki Clan along with Oden-{\i1}sama{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.46,0:10:34.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,His real name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.21,0:10:37.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...Shimotsuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.68,0:10:50.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasuie-{\i1}dono{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.07,0:10:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The Daimyo of Hakumai! Yasu the Hedgehog!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.11,0:11:06.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He was very austere and never smiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.00,0:11:12.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't realize\Nbecause he's nothing like he used to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop the execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,--I'm from Hakumai!\N--I'm glad to see you again...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.80,0:11:20.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Untie him, damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.67,0:11:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasuie-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.77,0:11:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,People did not forget me yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.90,0:11:35.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.61,0:11:51.33,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,HAKUMAI, LAND OF WANO
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.45,0:11:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This Hakumai is the only region in the Land of Wano\Nthat has a legitimate port.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Some visitors wish us \Nwell, others wish us harm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:11:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.09,0:12:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...we need to be an unassailable army.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.09,0:12:05.05,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,SHIMOTSUKI YASUIE (LATER KNOWN AS TONOYASU)\NDAIMYO OF HAKUMAI
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:17.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They are definitely the strongest samurai\Nin the Land of Wano...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.03,0:12:25.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.49,0:12:30.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Stop fooling around, Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.08,0:12:40.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How long are you going to hang out at my place?\NYou are the son of the Shogun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:46.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I got kicked out of the castle.\NI do not know if there is still a blood tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.26,0:12:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone is saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.97,0:12:54.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...that Oden will not be the heir\Nto Kozuki Sukiyaki...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.77,0:12:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasuie will become the Shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.40,0:13:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.07,0:13:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.12,0:13:14.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't take silly talk like that seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.96,0:13:22.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You are the true successor \Nof the Kozuki Clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.30,0:13:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sukiyaki-{\i1}sama{\i0} kicked you out\Nbecause he loves you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.63,0:13:29.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Try to live up to his expectations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasu-{\i1}san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.89,0:13:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I would rather go out to the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.61,0:13:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why doesn't this country allow that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.99,0:13:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The isolation policy is just annoying!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.33,0:13:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.00,0:14:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Say whatever you like\Nafter becoming a real samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.76,0:14:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You are hurting me!\NHow dare you keep punching me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.10,0:14:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Who do you think I am?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.56,0:14:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You are still a nobody...\NJust a hoodlum.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.32,0:14:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasuie-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.89,0:14:59.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It is no use, everyone!\NOrochi will not let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.81,0:15:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,First, I want to apologize to everyone\Nabout two things!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.73,0:15:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then I want to say one thing\Nto the stupid Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.19,0:15:47.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,After I say those things,\NI can leave for kingdom come, laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.04,0:16:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.06,0:16:23.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasuie-{\i1}sama{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.07,0:16:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The next hit will be a killing blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will read the charges of the accused.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.29,0:16:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Last night, he committed a \Ntheft in the Flower Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.46,0:16:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He has fallen dreadfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.26,0:16:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He is the former Daimyo of Hakumai\Nwho makes a living as a male geisha!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.68,0:17:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,His name is Shimotsuki Yasuie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.14,0:17:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For the heinous crime of rebelling against\Nthe Shogun Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0} in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.81,0:17:12.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,as an offering to the \NOiran Komurasaki's grave,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.94,0:17:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,we hereby sentence him to dishonorable death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.45,0:17:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, according to his statement,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.20,0:17:29.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,he was Ushimitsu Kozo\Nwho caused a disturbance to the public...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.13,0:17:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.71,0:17:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.22,0:17:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I said it because I wanted to get all the attention\Nif I die anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.68,0:17:45.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm sorry that I lied.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.43,0:17:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm no hero like that!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.73,0:17:50.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasuie-{\i1}dono{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.44,0:17:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why did he tell such a lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:18:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The sorrow from Komurasaki's funeral\Nhas been directed to Yasuie's execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.20,0:18:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Drake-{\i1}san{\i0}! The people of Ebisu Town\Nare charging into the Flower Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.00,0:18:11.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.84,0:18:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess he is a bigger \Nfigure than we imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasu-{\i1}san{\i0}, don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.94,0:18:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasu-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.48,0:18:36.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If we lose you,\Nwho else will support us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.03,0:18:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't enter this town without permission!\NGo back to Ebisu Town, you beggars!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.41,0:18:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasu-{\i1}san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.35,0:19:08.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These small actions won't draw the attention of\Nthe Animal Kingdom Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.96,0:19:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasu-{\i1}san{\i0}, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:40.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The residents on the main street\Nare raging!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,In the west district, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.97,0:19:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's one thing after another!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.22,0:19:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Orochi-{\i1}sama{\i0}'s decision to broadcast the execution\Nthrough the Light-Scrolls could backfire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.02,0:19:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Keep an eye on other areas, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:04.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Shogun-{\i1}dono{\i0} is such an idiot,\NI feel sorry for his subordinates!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.53,0:20:08.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:23.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at the beautiful Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.72,0:20:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The view of the Land of Wano is magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.62,0:21:01.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,For generations, this scenery was developed by\Nthe Kozuki Clan and the common people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.92,0:21:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We take pride in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.05,0:21:06.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.64,0:21:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.01,0:21:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's started talking shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.19,0:21:18.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You cannot take the credit \Nfor that, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.65,0:21:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kurozumi Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Do you hear me, Orochi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.84,0:21:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There used to be immense forests\Nand fields with vegetation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.22,0:21:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rivers!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.39,0:21:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Villages!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.19,0:22:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And you are just contaminating them\Nwith dirt of greed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.57,0:22:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're nothing but vermin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.70,0:22:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.58,0:22:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yasuie-{\i1}dono{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.06,0:22:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:09.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daddy!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.52,0:23:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Entrusting the Land of Wano's future to the Straw Hats,\NTonoyasu dies with a smile on his face!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.52,0:23:30.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The people of Ebisu Town grieve,\Nbut Zoro sees them laughing hysterically!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.03,0:23:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}When he learns the truth behind their smiles,\Nhe becomes furious!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.45,0:23:40.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,On the next episode of One Piece!\N"Zoro's Fury! The Truth About the Smile!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.66,0:23:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.38,0:23:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.38,0:23:48.38,On Top,,0000,0000,0000,,
